{
 "//": "Tool-calling eval cases for the Hermes chip agent (desktop / Open WebUI). Fields: expect_tools (all called), expect_any (one of), args (tool -> arg -> exact value | [alternatives] | 're:<regex>' | {contains:[..]} | 'absent'), forbid_tools, tools_optional (tool check skipped; forbid_tools and answer still count), no_tools (no tool except neutral ones), answer (chat mode only: metric | must_contain_regex | not_regex | any_words), side_effect (gui|memory: skipped in chat mode unless --allow-gui / --allow-memory), needs_tools (case is 'pending' while one is not served; read_log, open_gds and capability_map were added on 2026-10-07). Neutral tools never counted: context_brief, memory_digest, job_list, job_status unless a case expects them. Run cases never start a job: the runner compares job_list before and after, and confirm cases use bogus ids.",
